# ── EIDOLON — Ignored Files & Runtime Artifacts ───────────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is generated at runtime or contains sensitive local
# state. A fresh clone boots cleanly into the onboarding flow without any of
# these files committed.

# ── Secrets & Credentials (NEVER commit) ──────────────────────────────────────
config/api_keys.json
config/certs/
config/whatsapp_web/
certification/
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal Memory & Local Vector Stores ─────────────────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
memoire/

# ── Local Agent Source Binaries & Generated Outputs ───────────────────────────
agents/*.pdf
agents/*.zip
output/
uploads/
scratch/
scratch_*.txt
test_search*.py
Rapport_*.pdf

# ── IDE Bridge Runtime Markers ────────────────────────────────────────────────
config/ide_bridge.*.running
config/ide_bridge.json

# ── Python Build & Cache Artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Virtual Environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors, Agent Caches & OS Noise ──────────────────────────────────────────
.gemini/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Logs & Media Runtime Output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
